WEBVTT

01:34.900 --> 01:37.610
[Bloom Life]

01:38.560 --> 01:42.440
[2007]

01:40.640 --> 01:41.860
The prince and the princess

01:41.860 --> 01:43.990
lived happily ever after.

01:44.690 --> 01:46.530
How about we play princesses?

01:52.220 --> 01:54.020
What's so good about a princess?

01:54.070 --> 01:56.150
She has to walk like that.

01:56.780 --> 01:58.670
Either being tricked by a wicked queen

01:58.670 --> 02:00.230
or chased by an evil dragon.

02:03.570 --> 02:05.700
Always needing someone to rescue her.

02:05.940 --> 02:08.340
Who says a princess always needs rescuing?

02:08.500 --> 02:09.470
Minawar could play

02:09.470 --> 02:10.470
a brave princess.

02:11.420 --> 02:14.650
The kind that's pretty, beautiful,
and courageous.

02:15.160 --> 02:16.490
I want to play an elf,

02:16.579 --> 02:17.920
a magic-wielding elf.

02:17.930 --> 02:21.579
I can make everyone happy
with a wave of my wand,

02:22.079 --> 02:23.210
except the bad guys.

02:23.470 --> 02:24.420
What about you, Arzugul?

02:24.420 --> 02:26.510
I'm definitely going to play the prince.

02:26.510 --> 02:27.930
I'll defeat the evil dragon

02:27.930 --> 02:29.060
and save my kingdom.

02:30.300 --> 02:31.360
Here is your crown!

02:44.240 --> 02:47.710
[Episode 4: Food and weeds grow together]

02:59.590 --> 03:02.930
As the old saying goes,
the distance between your eyebrows

03:03.020 --> 03:08.080
is the distance you'll travel from home.

03:08.330 --> 03:09.610
I've applied Osman grass to your eyebrows

03:09.610 --> 03:12.870
since you were little,

03:12.870 --> 03:16.410
because I hope you'll stay close to home.

03:17.610 --> 03:19.490
It's fine if you don't go to Shanghai.

03:19.490 --> 03:22.600
Stay home and be closer to Grandma.

03:30.430 --> 03:32.320
Is your dad still not eating?

03:34.020 --> 03:35.070
No.

03:35.440 --> 03:36.490
It's different this time.

03:36.490 --> 03:38.430
Before, no matter how big the problem was,

03:38.430 --> 03:42.340
I could go coax him, and it would work.

03:44.270 --> 03:46.870
My dad cares more about his face
than anything.

03:48.040 --> 03:49.770
But this time he's really hurt.

03:50.400 --> 03:52.770
It's not just about face.

03:52.800 --> 03:54.500
He's worried about you.

03:54.740 --> 03:57.050
You need to think it over yourself.

04:14.140 --> 04:15.710
Your in-laws are not easy to deal with.

04:15.710 --> 04:17.470
We're all afraid you'll get bullied.

04:17.470 --> 04:19.410
What else can I do, Arzugul?

04:19.940 --> 04:22.440
Sadiq and I are the ones living together.

04:23.230 --> 04:25.630
If I have to, I'll just keep out of
their way.

04:29.110 --> 04:30.340
Don't worry about me.

04:30.360 --> 04:31.360
Look at yourself.

04:39.580 --> 04:41.159
So beautiful.

04:52.990 --> 04:54.220
I told you.

04:54.240 --> 04:56.100
That Gulhumar is no simple woman.

04:56.260 --> 04:59.210
And her daughter is fierce too.

05:00.710 --> 05:03.960
On the wedding day, she tore down
the bride's red cloth

05:04.380 --> 05:05.500
straight away.

05:06.720 --> 05:08.050
And at the wedding,

05:08.560 --> 05:09.880
Sadiq's family

05:10.150 --> 05:12.880
didn't exchange a single word
with their family.

05:13.850 --> 05:16.850
Uncle Elishir's face was beyond grim.

05:16.850 --> 05:17.640
Is it?

05:17.640 --> 05:18.680
Kid,

05:18.830 --> 05:21.450
watch your mouth and don't talk nonsense.

05:21.850 --> 05:25.410
I think those two families getting married

05:25.410 --> 05:29.880
is like an ant marrying an elephant.

05:30.010 --> 05:32.680
An ant marries an elephant.

05:33.770 --> 05:36.600
A few days later, the elephant dies.

05:36.630 --> 05:39.190
What does the ant do then?

05:39.210 --> 05:39.950
Do you know?

05:40.130 --> 05:41.790
It tries to bury the elephant.

05:41.920 --> 05:44.120
It keeps trying,

05:44.150 --> 05:47.090
spending its whole life doing it.

05:48.680 --> 05:50.030
As far as I know,

05:50.230 --> 05:51.830
here's how it really went...

05:52.350 --> 05:53.050
Go on.

05:53.520 --> 05:54.480
Why did you stop?

05:55.560 --> 05:56.320
Go on.

05:56.640 --> 05:58.560
Tell me what you know.

06:03.070 --> 06:05.420
How could you gossip with them like that?

06:05.440 --> 06:07.040
I was just stating the facts.

06:07.770 --> 06:09.080
Sadiq's family are snobs.

06:09.080 --> 06:09.710
Everyone knows that.

06:09.710 --> 06:11.030
You were not stating the facts.

06:11.030 --> 06:12.490
You were just stirring up trouble.

06:12.490 --> 06:14.550
How is she supposed to live this down?

06:16.620 --> 06:18.250
I saw you two from far away.

06:18.520 --> 06:19.930
Are you two young lovers having a spat?

06:19.930 --> 06:21.310
Who are you calling lovers?

06:21.310 --> 06:22.960
If you can't talk properly,
just don't say anything.

06:22.960 --> 06:24.540
With so many people in your family,

06:24.540 --> 06:26.130
none of you know how to talk properly.

06:26.130 --> 06:27.930
What did my family ever do to you?

06:27.950 --> 06:28.590
Minawar's little sister

06:28.590 --> 06:29.260
is my little sister too, right?

06:29.260 --> 06:31.720
Come here, I'll teach you how to
talk to elders.

06:31.720 --> 06:33.120
Sorry, Brother-in-law.

06:33.180 --> 06:34.440
This kid is a bit rowdy.

06:34.909 --> 06:35.659
I'll take her home.

06:35.659 --> 06:36.260
Shut up.

06:36.870 --> 06:38.200
Little girl, with such a bad temper,

06:38.200 --> 06:39.420
who would dare marry you?

06:39.420 --> 06:41.150
Don't make sarcastic remarks there.

06:41.150 --> 06:41.930
I'll just say what I want.

06:41.930 --> 06:43.060
You think you're great just because
you're rich?

06:43.060 --> 06:44.000
Yes, I'm great.

06:44.020 --> 06:45.080
You're great?

06:45.100 --> 06:45.860
You're great?

06:45.860 --> 06:46.920
What are you doing?

06:48.130 --> 06:49.240
I just smashed it, so what?

06:49.240 --> 06:50.170
I'll pay for it.

06:50.580 --> 06:52.610
Are you out of your mind?

06:54.020 --> 06:54.870
What are you doing?

06:54.870 --> 06:55.730
What happened?

06:55.880 --> 06:56.760
What happened?

06:56.780 --> 06:57.740
Honey, you came at the right time.

06:57.740 --> 06:58.570
It was just a joke.

06:58.570 --> 06:59.590
Was it necessary to smash my car?

06:59.590 --> 07:00.260
You're talking nonsense.

07:00.260 --> 07:01.520
What do you mean by “talking nonsense”?

07:01.520 --> 07:02.820
She has such a bad temper.

07:02.820 --> 07:04.090
You started it on me first.

07:04.090 --> 07:05.470
What do you mean by
“I started on you first”?

07:05.470 --> 07:06.890
Say a little less. Say a little less.

07:06.890 --> 07:07.690
Laili,

07:07.920 --> 07:09.800
when will you ever change
this temper of yours?

07:09.800 --> 07:10.320
Go inside.

07:10.320 --> 07:10.820
Fine, fine.

07:10.820 --> 07:12.080
Honey, don't be angry.

07:12.130 --> 07:13.280
Let's go, hurry up.

07:13.630 --> 07:14.600
Alright, it's nothing.

07:14.600 --> 07:15.350
Laili,

07:15.650 --> 07:17.450
I'll go and have it fixed myself.

07:18.640 --> 07:20.240
What's going on with you two?

07:20.870 --> 07:21.990
One of you made a scene at my wedding,

07:21.990 --> 07:23.660
upsetting the whole family.

07:24.690 --> 07:26.790
And the other, within days,
smashed my husband's car.

07:26.790 --> 07:28.340
Yes, we have nothing better to do.

07:28.340 --> 07:30.090
But weren't we doing it for your own good?

07:30.090 --> 07:33.620
Your mother‑in‑law and the others
really went too far that day.

07:33.920 --> 07:34.520
To be honest,

07:34.520 --> 07:35.320
I don't care at all

07:35.320 --> 07:36.920
what Sadiq's family is like.

07:38.159 --> 07:40.640
As long as he can take me
away from the inn, it's fine.

07:40.640 --> 07:42.900
What did the Camel Bell Inn
ever do to you?

07:47.610 --> 07:49.340
Can you smell that smell?

07:50.530 --> 07:51.420
What smell?

07:52.810 --> 07:54.140
The smell of livestock.

07:54.290 --> 07:57.090
The livestock pen was torn down
over ten years ago.

07:57.850 --> 07:59.850
But I can still smell it.

08:01.450 --> 08:03.710
I feel like it's forever stuck in my nose.

08:06.760 --> 08:08.760
Of course you don't mind that smell,

08:08.880 --> 08:11.310
because this is just a temporary stop
for you.

08:11.310 --> 08:13.000
But I'm not like you, Arzugul.

08:13.270 --> 08:14.690
I was born here.

08:16.000 --> 08:16.910
Sometimes I feel

08:16.910 --> 08:18.860
like I'll never get out of this place
this whole life.

08:18.860 --> 08:20.380
Wasn't I born here too?

08:20.630 --> 08:22.630
Isn't this the place that raised me?

08:23.670 --> 08:24.290
You just don't know

08:24.290 --> 08:25.840
how much I envy you

08:25.870 --> 08:27.640
every day when I see your family
all together.

08:27.640 --> 08:29.330
I wish I could live here
with my mom and dad too.

08:29.330 --> 08:30.640
That's because you've been outside.

08:30.640 --> 08:32.039
Can you understand that?

08:37.120 --> 08:39.380
Those girls I used to learn dance with...

08:39.830 --> 08:41.419
Some married big bosses.

08:42.200 --> 08:44.340
Some found rich boys.

08:44.540 --> 08:46.300
I also want a beautiful house

08:46.360 --> 08:47.620
and my own car.

08:47.640 --> 08:48.980
You can have them.

08:49.010 --> 08:50.460
You can get them by yourself.

08:50.460 --> 08:52.190
Why do you have to rely on others?

08:52.190 --> 08:54.030
You always say “by yourself, by yourself.”

08:54.030 --> 08:55.730
Didn't your house in Shanghai also
run into trouble?

08:55.730 --> 08:56.170
I got the house in Shanghai

08:56.170 --> 08:57.950
also through my own hard work.

08:57.980 --> 08:58.720
So what now?

08:58.740 --> 09:01.070
Did I get it through my own hard work
or not?

09:02.810 --> 09:04.340
Both of you, say a little less.

09:04.340 --> 09:06.340
That's just how the world works.

09:06.500 --> 09:08.040
I will grow old and ugly.

09:08.200 --> 09:09.530
There will always be someone
to replace me.

09:09.530 --> 09:11.640
How long can I keep dancing
in the song and dance troupe?

09:11.640 --> 09:13.530
Stop bringing your big‑city mentality

09:13.530 --> 09:14.530
over here, alright?

09:14.530 --> 09:16.030
What “big‑city mentality” of ours?

09:16.030 --> 09:17.620
Now I have nothing.

09:17.720 --> 09:18.670
I lost my job.

09:18.690 --> 09:19.310
I lost my house.

09:19.310 --> 09:20.040
I have nothing at all.

09:20.040 --> 09:21.840
What “mentality” do I have left?

09:22.430 --> 09:23.670
Say a little less.

09:23.960 --> 09:25.620
Both of you, say a little less.

09:26.220 --> 09:27.430
And you, Laili,

09:27.860 --> 09:29.250
do you think you know me so well?

09:29.250 --> 09:30.740
You don't know me at all.

09:30.770 --> 09:32.560
Just don't make trouble for me,
that's all.

09:32.560 --> 09:34.340
Right. No one knows you.

09:34.370 --> 09:35.970
Only you know yourself best.

09:57.810 --> 09:58.550
Nur,

09:59.730 --> 10:01.110
tell me.

10:02.270 --> 10:04.190
We all grew up here.

10:04.900 --> 10:06.480
Why do they look down on me?

10:06.900 --> 10:09.070
I own a shop in the busiest spot

10:09.100 --> 10:11.030
in the old town.

10:11.740 --> 10:14.200
That was over ten years ago.

10:14.230 --> 10:16.600
It's different now.

10:16.620 --> 10:18.620
How many times have I told you?

10:19.750 --> 10:22.920
Renovate your shop.

10:23.170 --> 10:25.040
But you just won't listen to me.

10:25.520 --> 10:28.420
If you decorate your shop
and make it look nice,

10:28.510 --> 10:30.400
then the money will just

10:30.400 --> 10:32.580
come flowing in.

10:32.950 --> 10:35.040
Do you know how much

10:35.060 --> 10:37.800
that Dragon Spring Homestay costs
per night?

10:38.630 --> 10:40.630
It's just three hundred yuan.

10:41.630 --> 10:42.890
What are you talking about?

10:42.890 --> 10:43.910
Not three hundred.

10:43.910 --> 10:45.380
When there're a lot of tourists
in the old town,

10:45.380 --> 10:47.970
it can make fifteen hundred a night.

10:48.000 --> 10:49.150
Fifteen hundred?

10:51.400 --> 10:52.490
Even an emperor's palace

10:52.490 --> 10:55.220
wouldn't cost fifteen hundred a night,
would it?

10:55.630 --> 10:57.960
Timur, do you agree?

10:59.990 --> 11:01.510
Timur won't say anything.

11:01.650 --> 11:03.870
Timur has very sharp ears,

11:03.990 --> 11:05.740
but he says nothing.

11:07.060 --> 11:09.130
Every wrinkle on Timur's face

11:09.200 --> 11:12.050
hides everyone's secrets.

11:14.420 --> 11:15.220
Ah, by the way,

11:16.300 --> 11:20.350
you used to sing Peking Opera really well.

11:21.350 --> 11:24.830
I haven't sung that song for a long time.

11:24.860 --> 11:27.790
You haven't forgotten it, have you?
Sing a bit for us.

11:28.060 --> 11:30.870
♪ Wearing a red star on my head ♪

11:30.890 --> 11:33.840
♪ Red flags of revolution on both sides ♪

11:33.870 --> 11:36.150
♪ Where the red flag points,
dark clouds scatter ♪

11:36.170 --> 11:39.840
♪ The people of the liberated area overthrow
the landlords and stand up ♪

11:39.970 --> 11:45.420
♪ The people's army ♪

11:45.560 --> 11:50.370
♪ shares weal and woe with the people ♪

11:50.400 --> 11:53.030
♪ They have come here ♪

11:53.350 --> 11:55.880
♪ to wipe out bandits
in the Tiger Mountain ♪

11:56.010 --> 11:58.130
Bravo!

12:06.240 --> 12:07.230
Grandma,

12:08.460 --> 12:10.920
can I sleep with you tonight?

12:12.150 --> 12:14.260
Did you three have a fight?

12:17.330 --> 12:18.950
Are you angry?

12:22.010 --> 12:24.510
Grandma.

12:24.530 --> 12:25.590
My granddaughter.

12:26.570 --> 12:28.190
Do you know why

12:29.130 --> 12:32.900
on the rooftops of our house
and your friend Laili's house,

12:32.920 --> 12:36.770
low walls that even a lamb can jump over

12:37.080 --> 12:39.510
are still standing there?

12:40.870 --> 12:43.540
No matter how close two people are,

12:43.920 --> 12:48.580
they shouldn't cross the line.

12:50.040 --> 12:51.870
I see, Grandma.

13:00.370 --> 13:01.460
Young man,

13:01.460 --> 13:02.470
weren't you going to stay for three days?

13:02.470 --> 13:03.780
Why are you leaving now?

13:03.780 --> 13:05.540
The facilities in your rooms

13:05.540 --> 13:06.900
are too terrible.

13:07.000 --> 13:09.250
The hair dryer trips the breaker
every time we use it.

13:09.250 --> 13:10.090
For the past two days, my girlfriend

13:10.090 --> 13:11.550
had to sleep with wet hair.

13:11.820 --> 13:13.080
What do you say to that?

13:13.300 --> 13:15.140
We just spent over 200 yuan on medicine.

13:15.140 --> 13:16.510
We won't ask you to pay for it.

13:16.510 --> 13:18.040
Just refund us the room fee for the two days
and the deposit

13:18.040 --> 13:19.430
to our original payment account.

13:19.430 --> 13:20.570
Miss,

13:20.850 --> 13:22.350
if you put it that way,

13:22.370 --> 13:24.100
you are making it difficult for me.

13:24.100 --> 13:25.000
Bro,

13:25.350 --> 13:26.550
is this the medicine?

13:27.830 --> 13:28.520
Uncle,

13:28.550 --> 13:29.260
you made a mistake.

13:29.260 --> 13:30.790
You delivered it to my room.

13:34.700 --> 13:36.680
It's 30.75 yuan.

13:37.090 --> 13:38.350
Nowhere near 200 yuan.

13:39.800 --> 13:40.320
Bro,

13:41.010 --> 13:42.110
when you are away from home,

13:42.110 --> 13:44.040
you shouldn't be hard on yourself,

13:44.260 --> 13:46.990
nor should you make things difficult
for others.

13:48.860 --> 13:49.930
Keep the medicine.

13:49.950 --> 13:50.810
How about this?

13:50.950 --> 13:52.400
We will give you a 20% discount.

13:52.400 --> 13:53.640
And we'll return the deposit to you.

13:53.640 --> 13:54.450
Is that okay?

13:55.250 --> 13:56.130
Alright, alright.

13:56.130 --> 13:57.340
Let's leave it at that.

13:57.340 --> 13:58.440
Then refund the money quickly.

13:58.440 --> 13:59.970
Yes, yes. Sorry about that.

14:00.000 --> 14:01.260
Sorry, sorry.

14:01.280 --> 14:02.500
Enjoy your stay!

14:03.690 --> 14:04.430
Young man,

14:04.840 --> 14:06.750
why is your hair all wet?

14:07.470 --> 14:08.440
Well, Uncle,

14:08.710 --> 14:10.640
your water heater

14:10.670 --> 14:11.920
alternates between hot and cold.

14:11.920 --> 14:12.510
And also,

14:12.510 --> 14:13.370
the Wi-Fi

14:13.390 --> 14:14.540
keeps disconnecting.

14:14.540 --> 14:15.120
Well,

14:15.300 --> 14:16.780
I won't check out.

14:17.130 --> 14:18.830
Just give me a 30% discount,

14:19.410 --> 14:20.010
alright?

14:20.490 --> 14:21.090
Stop it, stop it.

14:21.090 --> 14:22.040
Let's have breakfast first.

14:22.040 --> 14:23.010
We Kashgar people

14:23.010 --> 14:24.160
don't talk about sad things

14:24.160 --> 14:25.460
during breakfast.

14:25.460 --> 14:26.750
Come on.

14:26.750 --> 14:27.470
Have breakfast first.

14:27.470 --> 14:28.560
Come here.

14:29.370 --> 14:29.870
Sit down and have breakfast.

14:29.870 --> 14:30.870
Uncle, 20% discount, alright?

14:30.870 --> 14:31.750
No, no, no.

14:31.750 --> 14:33.160
The faucet is broken again!

14:33.160 --> 14:33.630
Take a seat.

14:33.630 --> 14:35.510
I'll go fix the faucet for you.

14:35.700 --> 14:36.900
I'm to fix the faucet.

14:36.920 --> 14:37.580
I'm coming.

14:39.910 --> 14:44.150
Many old craftsmen
can't make this pot well.

14:45.680 --> 14:46.880
It's just because...

14:49.210 --> 14:51.140
Master, does your hand hurt again?

14:52.460 --> 14:53.060
Dad,

14:54.230 --> 14:55.020
let me do it.

14:55.610 --> 14:57.180
I bought you gloves.

14:57.180 --> 14:58.780
Why aren't you wearing them?

14:58.860 --> 15:00.950
You don't listen to the doctor at all.

15:01.300 --> 15:02.900
Those gloves are too big.

15:03.250 --> 15:04.430
I can't feel anything.

15:04.430 --> 15:06.230
Then go ahead and ruin your hand.

15:06.660 --> 15:07.420
Alright, alright.

15:07.420 --> 15:08.820
It doesn't hurt anymore.

15:08.900 --> 15:10.500
Go back to your own business.

15:11.850 --> 15:14.130
What's a girl doing making trouble here?

15:15.130 --> 15:18.130
Look, this pot still isn't good enough.

15:18.150 --> 15:20.430
Hold the clay with your hands

15:20.460 --> 15:23.320
and pull it up slowly like this.

15:34.660 --> 15:35.570
What's wrong?

15:36.090 --> 15:37.990
-Grandma.
-Are you upset, Laili?

15:39.600 --> 15:41.600
No, Grandma.

15:42.010 --> 15:44.010
That's good.

15:44.460 --> 15:46.590
Then don't just play with your phone.

15:46.880 --> 15:49.560
Help Grandma with some chores.

15:49.590 --> 15:50.790
No problem, Grandma.

16:06.850 --> 16:09.400
Grandma, are you sure the radio is
on the rooftop?

16:09.400 --> 16:12.140
I thought I saw it on the courtyard bed
yesterday.

16:13.370 --> 16:16.400
It should be on the rooftop.
Go up and check.

16:26.440 --> 16:28.580
If you don't make up,

16:29.290 --> 16:31.980
none of you are allowed to come out.

16:32.000 --> 16:32.570
Grandma!

16:33.460 --> 16:34.160
Grandma!

16:34.460 --> 16:35.230
Grandma!

16:35.510 --> 16:36.060
Grandma!

16:36.400 --> 16:37.490
We made up.

16:37.730 --> 16:39.710
Grandma, we really made up.

16:39.820 --> 16:41.210
You really did?

16:41.300 --> 16:42.160
Really.

16:43.230 --> 16:44.960
Then hug each other and show me.

17:02.780 --> 17:04.660
♪ The ripe red apple ♪

17:04.680 --> 17:12.210
♪ Just like my lover's red face ♪

17:12.240 --> 17:15.980
♪ The tender whisper of the lover ♪

17:16.000 --> 17:19.630
♪ is as sweet as sugar ♪

17:19.650 --> 17:23.119
♪ The tender whisper of the lover ♪

17:23.140 --> 17:26.920
♪ is as sweet as sugar ♪

17:26.950 --> 17:31.970
♪ A lover like pomegranate ♪

17:28.380 --> 17:31.270
Gulistan, you dance just as well as
she does.

17:45.270 --> 17:46.530
What's wrong with you?

17:49.680 --> 17:50.470
What's up?

17:50.860 --> 17:51.920
What kind of perfume did you buy?

17:51.920 --> 17:53.180
The smell is so strong.

17:54.510 --> 17:55.460
Is it strong?

17:55.810 --> 17:57.070
We bought it together.

17:57.490 --> 17:58.570
Minawar.

17:58.570 --> 18:00.700
What's wrong? Are you feeling unwell?

18:01.430 --> 18:02.190
I'm fine.

18:02.210 --> 18:03.010
I'm fine.

18:03.660 --> 18:04.230
I'm fine.

18:34.670 --> 18:36.000
You look like a refugee.

18:36.300 --> 18:37.430
I just hope you would

18:37.430 --> 18:39.320
let me help you a little.

18:39.510 --> 18:40.880
I am really a "refugee."

18:41.170 --> 18:42.950
Everything I owned in Shanghai

18:43.410 --> 18:45.710
is right here. So heavy.

18:57.230 --> 18:58.010
Sorry.

18:58.230 --> 18:59.760
This box isn't very sturdy.

19:00.360 --> 19:01.070
Sorry.

19:04.510 --> 19:06.440
Architectural Design Portfolio.

19:13.660 --> 19:14.900
Did you draw this?

19:16.180 --> 19:16.840
No, wait.

19:17.320 --> 19:18.890
You majored in architectural design.

19:18.890 --> 19:20.090
How did you end up in real estate sales?

19:20.090 --> 19:21.220
And you draw so well.

19:21.660 --> 19:23.390
It would be a pity to give it up.

19:23.860 --> 19:24.750
Don't act like

19:24.750 --> 19:26.610
you don't know the cost of living.

19:27.570 --> 19:28.970
Right after graduation,

19:29.110 --> 19:30.350
it was so hard to find a job.

19:30.350 --> 19:31.660
You know that as well as I do.

19:31.660 --> 19:32.400
As for me,

19:32.400 --> 19:34.800
I was dead set on buying a house
in Shanghai.

19:36.050 --> 19:37.070
I was afraid if I didn't buy one then,

19:37.070 --> 19:39.000
I would never be able to afford one.

19:40.730 --> 19:43.490
It's not exactly giving up.

19:44.260 --> 19:46.020
The design you just saw

19:46.040 --> 19:47.910
was for a part-time job I got online.

19:47.910 --> 19:49.620
Though there weren't many orders,

19:49.620 --> 19:51.010
and it didn't pay much.

19:52.250 --> 19:54.310
Do you know Metro Line 11 in Shanghai?

19:54.880 --> 19:55.960
Line 11?

19:56.300 --> 19:57.430
I know it.

19:58.860 --> 19:59.660
What about it?

19:59.720 --> 20:01.780
The house I bought is right by Line 11.

20:02.600 --> 20:03.900
Isn't that nice?

20:04.900 --> 20:06.420
Huaqiao Station, Line 11.

20:10.930 --> 20:12.860
I think Jiangsu is pretty good too.

20:13.140 --> 20:15.050
Good environment and good value for money.

20:15.050 --> 20:16.270
No worse than Shanghai.

20:16.270 --> 20:16.970
Right.

20:17.920 --> 20:18.730
I remember

20:18.990 --> 20:21.720
the day I bought the house
was the Spring Equinox.

20:21.800 --> 20:22.800
Around that time,

20:23.870 --> 20:25.700
the migrating birds

20:25.700 --> 20:27.210
and ducks

20:27.650 --> 20:30.950
all returned to the stream by the meadow.

20:31.880 --> 20:33.740
Even they all settled down there.

20:41.100 --> 20:41.890
Alright.

20:42.260 --> 20:42.820
Let's go.

20:43.570 --> 20:44.210
Let me do it.

20:44.210 --> 20:45.180
I can make it.

20:45.180 --> 20:46.100
The cart is so heavy.

20:46.100 --> 20:47.530
It's really not heavy. I can handle it.

20:47.530 --> 20:48.380
Are you sure?

20:48.400 --> 20:49.190
Yes.

20:50.870 --> 20:52.000
You are so stubborn.

20:52.160 --> 20:53.590
Why are you so stubborn as a mule?

20:53.590 --> 20:55.450
Yeah, I'm just stubborn as a mule.

20:55.940 --> 20:57.140
Don't push yourself.

21:20.410 --> 21:22.610
One, two, three.

21:38.120 --> 21:39.030
Sorry.

21:39.850 --> 21:40.760
Does it hurt?

21:43.320 --> 21:44.290
What?

21:44.910 --> 21:47.040
Are you going to take responsibility?

21:49.920 --> 21:51.550
I was just kidding.

21:54.610 --> 21:56.580
If I can't carry you to the peak of life,

21:56.580 --> 21:58.640
at least when you're going downhill,

21:58.770 --> 22:00.900
there's someone to cushion your fall.

22:07.070 --> 22:07.880
Xia Zi.

22:10.020 --> 22:11.620
I want to give you a job offer.

22:28.570 --> 22:29.810
I want to turn this entire shop

22:29.810 --> 22:30.990
into the most distinctive

22:30.990 --> 22:32.790
new type of homestay in Kashgar.

22:33.550 --> 22:34.630
So I need someone

22:34.660 --> 22:36.280
who understands both aesthetics
and Kashgar

22:36.280 --> 22:38.010
to help me with the renovation.

22:38.380 --> 22:38.880
Also,

22:39.620 --> 22:41.960
I need you to help me convince the family.

23:03.440 --> 23:04.370
You can't sleep？

23:05.200 --> 23:06.400
I can't sleep either.

23:11.270 --> 23:12.180
Before,

23:12.200 --> 23:13.930
I used to work at a big tech firm.

23:14.160 --> 23:15.680
After paying rent each month,

23:15.680 --> 23:17.100
more than half of my salary was gone.

23:17.100 --> 23:19.070
I worked overtime until 9 p.m. every day,

23:19.070 --> 23:20.130
just like you said.

23:20.410 --> 23:23.540
Because after 9 p.m.,
the taxi ride home was reimbursed.

23:25.610 --> 23:27.070
Once I finally got home

23:27.090 --> 23:28.620
and had some time to myself,

23:28.650 --> 23:30.980
I got into the bad habit of
staying up late.

23:33.770 --> 23:35.300
Why are you telling me this?

23:35.530 --> 23:38.460
To say that you're as much of
a corporate slave as I am?

23:42.910 --> 23:44.320
I do have insomnia,

23:45.290 --> 23:46.720
but mine only started

23:46.740 --> 23:48.420
in the last couple of years.

23:49.340 --> 23:50.630
Whenever I can't sleep,

23:50.630 --> 23:52.130
I like listening to music.

23:53.330 --> 23:55.220
Maybe because I grew up here,

23:56.060 --> 23:57.360
I feel like

23:57.380 --> 23:59.320
singing and dancing

23:59.710 --> 24:01.830
are already in my blood.

24:04.180 --> 24:05.710
When I can't sleep at night,

24:05.810 --> 24:06.970
I just sing.

24:09.310 --> 24:11.710
When I can't see anything clearly
at night,

24:12.070 --> 24:13.350
I feel like

24:13.690 --> 24:16.330
the sound of singing can wrap around me
like a circle.

24:16.330 --> 24:17.930
It makes me feel really safe.

24:25.500 --> 24:29.130
♪ The sun goes down, but tomorrow
it will climb again ♪

24:29.420 --> 24:34.340
♪ The sun goes down, but tomorrow
it will climb again ♪

24:35.430 --> 24:39.960
♪ Flowers fade, but next year
they will bloom again ♪

24:40.690 --> 24:45.260
♪ The beautiful bird is gone
without a trace ♪

24:45.810 --> 24:50.490
♪ My youth, like that bird,
will never come back again ♪

24:51.100 --> 24:55.660
♪Don't do that, don't do that ♪

24:56.070 --> 25:00.960
♪ My youth, like that bird,
will never come back again ♪

25:01.860 --> 25:06.670
♪ The sun goes down, but tomorrow
it will climb again ♪

25:06.960 --> 25:12.090
♪ Flowers fade, but next year
they will bloom again ♪

25:07.470 --> 25:08.450
It's starting to rain.

25:08.450 --> 25:09.510
Let's go back.

25:12.440 --> 25:17.380
♪ The beautiful bird is gone
without a trace ♪

25:18.470 --> 25:22.920
♪ My youth, like that bird,
will never come back again ♪

25:42.510 --> 25:43.800
It's a match!

25:57.620 --> 25:58.400
My friend...

25:58.580 --> 25:59.020
Uncle.

25:59.050 --> 26:00.450
You're here just in time.

26:00.530 --> 26:03.730
Take a look at this internet-famous
check‑in spot I made.

26:04.000 --> 26:04.940
How is it?

26:04.190 --> 26:05.770
[I miss you at the Camel Bell Inn
in Kashgar]

26:06.020 --> 26:06.950
This won't work.

26:07.380 --> 26:09.240
The truth is, running a homestay nowadays

26:09.240 --> 26:10.990
can't rely just on these things.

26:10.990 --> 26:12.200
You need a complete set of

26:12.200 --> 26:14.000
operational logic and methods.

26:14.790 --> 26:15.710
You mean

26:15.710 --> 26:16.770
I should let someone else

26:16.770 --> 26:18.300
manage my place, is that it?

26:18.340 --> 26:20.040
As long as you cooperate with me,

26:20.040 --> 26:20.780
I promise

26:20.810 --> 26:22.940
to give you a completely renewed shop.

26:23.090 --> 26:23.820
How about it?

26:27.510 --> 26:28.400
No, no, no.

26:28.970 --> 26:29.950
No way.

26:30.680 --> 26:31.400
Uncle,

26:31.740 --> 26:32.920
please think about it.

26:32.920 --> 26:33.270
Alright,

26:33.270 --> 26:35.210
I'll think it over later.

26:40.120 --> 26:41.080
Hello.

26:43.950 --> 26:45.080
Wang has been found.

26:46.240 --> 26:46.900
Where?

26:52.650 --> 26:54.250
Hey, friend!

26:55.320 --> 26:56.910
Alimu is so unreliable.

26:57.420 --> 26:59.480
The car he found is even older than me.

26:59.490 --> 27:00.580
See?

27:00.740 --> 27:02.140
It broke down, didn't it?

27:02.310 --> 27:03.360
Wang's last transaction address

27:03.360 --> 27:04.750
provided by the police station

27:04.750 --> 27:06.280
is in Tuogelunxia Village.

27:06.290 --> 27:07.660
If we can flag down a ride now,

27:07.660 --> 27:09.400
we should be able to get there
before evening.

27:09.400 --> 27:10.920
Hey, mister!

27:11.370 --> 27:13.170
Could you give us a ride?

27:13.190 --> 27:13.700
Sure.

27:13.700 --> 27:14.280
Thank you.

27:14.280 --> 27:14.940
Thank you.

27:29.350 --> 27:31.040
Let me tell you.

27:31.060 --> 27:32.180
About that friend tracing app,

27:32.180 --> 27:33.460
I saw my colleague download it,

27:33.460 --> 27:34.550
so I just followed suit.

27:34.550 --> 27:36.750
Then I got too busy and never got back on.

27:36.760 --> 27:38.290
Don't read too much into it.

27:38.530 --> 27:39.590
We matched, right?

27:39.660 --> 27:41.920
That means you swiped right and chose me.

27:42.020 --> 27:44.060
So, does my look

27:44.080 --> 27:45.640
fit your type?

27:45.930 --> 27:47.930
How can you be so shameless?

27:47.960 --> 27:49.960
My finger just slipped at that time.

27:50.510 --> 27:52.810
I was just asking casually.

28:00.460 --> 28:01.940
Once we cross this little hill,

28:01.940 --> 28:03.870
we'll be able to enter the village.

28:03.970 --> 28:05.270
My car can't go in,

28:05.270 --> 28:06.870
so I'll have to drop you here.

28:06.900 --> 28:07.420
Okay.

28:07.420 --> 28:08.290
Thank you, bro.

28:08.380 --> 28:09.200
You're welcome.

28:09.200 --> 28:11.220
Guests are gifts from heaven.

28:11.730 --> 28:13.590
If we're fated, we'll meet again.

28:17.730 --> 28:19.390
Snowy mountains, here I come!

28:19.510 --> 28:20.700
Stop running!

28:22.840 --> 28:24.200
Stop running.

28:24.470 --> 28:26.400
This is the Pamirs.

28:26.400 --> 28:28.660
It's easy to get altitude sickness here.

28:31.970 --> 28:32.720
I can't go on.

28:33.280 --> 28:35.010
I'm a little oxygen‑deprived.

28:35.510 --> 28:37.470
Sorrow comes with too much joy.

28:38.130 --> 28:39.530
Can you keep going or not?

28:40.660 --> 28:41.590
What's the rush?

28:42.570 --> 28:44.170
Let me rest for a while first.

28:44.460 --> 28:46.940
Go rest. I'm not in a hurry anyway.

28:47.110 --> 28:48.570
Wang doesn't owe me money.

29:00.100 --> 29:03.030
You don't have to get up right away
when you fall down.

29:03.670 --> 29:05.070
Just lie down for a while.

29:06.360 --> 29:07.660
Look at the blue sky.

29:08.360 --> 29:09.530
Look at the clouds.

29:10.620 --> 29:12.150
Look at the birds in the sky.

29:14.770 --> 29:16.550
You have so many philosophies.

29:16.860 --> 29:18.400
Just give me a break.

29:19.510 --> 29:20.510
I'll listen to you

29:20.720 --> 29:22.200
and just lie flat, okay?

29:24.700 --> 29:26.600
It's not me who should give you a break.

29:26.600 --> 29:28.800
It's about you giving yourself a break.

30:32.090 --> 30:33.920
Did I just fall asleep?

30:38.190 --> 30:39.450
You dozed off for a bit.

30:47.230 --> 30:49.030
This place is really beautiful.

30:49.620 --> 30:52.150
We have to admit, Wang knows
how to pick a spot.

30:54.070 --> 30:55.990
If he hadn't cheated me out of my money,

30:55.990 --> 30:58.190
I'd really want to have a drink with him.

30:59.590 --> 31:05.090
♪ My beautiful Kuyinaziguli ♪

31:04.070 --> 31:05.790
Two packs of cigarettes,
two bottles of beer...

31:05.120 --> 31:11.760
♪ Your peerless beauty outshines
the mountain flowers ♪

31:05.790 --> 31:08.680
Two bottles of water,
and a pack of compressed biscuits.

31:08.680 --> 31:08.900
Oh!

31:09.290 --> 31:10.440
And a thick hat.

31:11.230 --> 31:12.750
You are his friends?

31:12.270 --> 31:17.570
♪ She's so stunning ♪

31:13.670 --> 31:16.380
Can you pay the rest of his bill?

31:16.550 --> 31:16.880
Okay.

31:17.530 --> 31:18.700
Okay, I'll pay.

31:17.600 --> 31:25.320
♪ I deeply fell in love with her ♪

31:20.460 --> 31:22.180
He still owes you money too.

31:22.490 --> 31:23.860
He might be in trouble.

31:25.340 --> 31:30.090
♪ She's so stunning ♪

31:26.420 --> 31:28.010
You're here to collect a debt, aren't you?

31:28.010 --> 31:29.340
I don't think you'll get it.

31:29.340 --> 31:31.810
He doesn't have 100 yuan to his name.

31:30.120 --> 31:36.810
♪ I deeply fell in love with her ♪

31:32.140 --> 31:34.200
How do you know he is hiding
from creditors?

31:34.200 --> 31:35.570
When a stranger shows up in the village,

31:35.570 --> 31:36.550
either the're a tourist,

31:36.550 --> 31:38.400
or they're visiting relatives or friends.

31:36.840 --> 31:42.100
♪ Now I'm alone at
a high mountain pasture ♪

31:38.400 --> 31:40.000
He doesn't look like either.

31:40.010 --> 31:41.210
I need to close up now.

31:41.250 --> 31:43.100
I'm in a hurry to get to a wedding.

31:42.130 --> 31:45.000
♪ My deep affection day and night
is so strong ♪

31:43.360 --> 31:44.890
It's okay. You can close up.

31:45.150 --> 31:47.380
♪ Would you stay a little longer
here beside me? ♪

31:45.470 --> 31:47.870
Why don't you two come with me
to see the fun?

31:58.860 --> 32:00.660
Right ahead is our wedding site.

32:00.900 --> 32:02.200
Our weddings are very lively.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.380
This is my first time attending

32:03.380 --> 32:04.550
a Tajik wedding.

32:04.550 --> 32:05.550
My first time too.

32:08.900 --> 32:10.160
Isn't that the driver?

32:10.750 --> 32:11.440
Uncle.

32:11.440 --> 32:13.310
Come, sit down.

32:13.750 --> 32:15.360
What a small world!

32:15.770 --> 32:17.660
Is this your family's wedding?

32:17.660 --> 32:19.790
Yes, it's my brother's son's wedding.

32:20.270 --> 32:21.710
Look at the dance they are doing.

32:21.710 --> 32:22.910
It's the eagle dance.

32:23.120 --> 32:25.660
We are the eagles on the Pamirs.

32:26.070 --> 32:28.470
We've guarded this place for generations.

32:52.310 --> 32:54.230
Come and sprinkle flour

32:54.230 --> 32:56.200
to bless the bride and groom!

33:01.470 --> 33:02.750
Congratulations!

33:07.170 --> 33:09.100
Let's go back to Kashgar tomorrow.

33:09.310 --> 33:10.960
You are not looking for Wang anymore?

33:10.960 --> 33:11.900
No.

33:12.140 --> 33:14.420
Maybe Wang really is
in some kind of trouble.

33:14.420 --> 33:15.200
Besides,

33:15.750 --> 33:17.140
such an adventure, such beautiful scenery,

33:17.140 --> 33:18.400
aren't they valuable?

33:19.570 --> 33:21.160
We didn't find the person we want,

33:21.160 --> 33:22.960
but it's totally worth the trip.

33:24.630 --> 33:26.830
I thought you were obsessed with money.

33:27.620 --> 33:28.510
I do love money,

33:29.030 --> 33:30.290
but not just money.

33:30.900 --> 33:32.630
I think such a good house

33:32.820 --> 33:34.360
shouldn't go to waste.

33:35.140 --> 33:35.840
What I want

33:35.840 --> 33:37.170
is a win-win situation.

33:39.710 --> 33:41.360
If you put it that way,

33:42.310 --> 33:44.490
I'll try to convince them for you.

33:44.990 --> 33:47.680
I don't want my family's place
to go out of business either.

33:47.680 --> 33:49.010
I accept your job offer.

33:49.440 --> 33:50.360
Okay, it's a deal then.

33:50.360 --> 33:51.160
It's a deal.

33:54.290 --> 33:55.380
A promise made

33:55.510 --> 33:56.470
can't be taken back.

33:56.470 --> 33:57.340
I'll do my best.

33:57.640 --> 33:58.700
I'll do my best too.

34:15.030 --> 34:15.889
Zhou Hengzhi.

36:25.050 --> 36:28.410
Sorry to make you share the communal bed
with us.

36:28.670 --> 36:31.010
It gets cold here at night.

36:31.420 --> 36:34.570
Sleeping close keeps you warm.

36:36.840 --> 36:38.010
Auntie, thank you. Sorry to trouble you.

36:38.010 --> 36:38.940
You are welcome.

36:39.030 --> 36:39.630
Thank you.

36:43.850 --> 36:44.610
There's only one quilt?

36:44.610 --> 36:45.420
Ah, yes.

36:45.690 --> 36:47.090
No, please give us two.

36:47.090 --> 36:48.490
Ah, okay.

36:49.840 --> 36:51.240
Auntie, let me do it.

36:51.460 --> 36:52.660
It's okay. I'll do it.

36:53.340 --> 36:53.670
Okay.

36:54.280 --> 36:55.630
Sorry for the trouble, Auntie.

36:55.630 --> 36:56.450
It's nothing.

37:01.900 --> 37:02.500
Thank you.

37:04.550 --> 37:05.260
It's done.

37:05.260 --> 37:05.960
Ah, okay.

37:06.470 --> 37:07.470
Ah, tired after a whole day.

37:07.470 --> 37:08.730
Finally time to sleep.

37:15.910 --> 37:17.370
Ah, well...

37:19.690 --> 37:22.050
I'm suddenly not sleepy.

37:22.070 --> 37:23.070
I won't sleep yet.

37:23.940 --> 37:25.140
You just sleep first.

37:25.670 --> 37:27.170
I'll keep a watch for you.

37:32.440 --> 37:33.350
You sleep.

37:33.470 --> 37:34.510
It's okay.

37:34.510 --> 37:35.550
I'm not sleepy.

37:37.610 --> 37:40.800
I'll just look at the

37:41.130 --> 37:42.990
starry sky outside. It's pretty.

38:35.360 --> 38:38.450
[Laili]

38:41.460 --> 38:44.410
I heard from grandma that you went to
Taxkorgan together.

38:44.410 --> 38:46.560
I sent her birthday wishes right on time,

38:46.560 --> 38:47.550
but she ignored me.

38:47.550 --> 38:48.610
Xia Zi's birthday?

38:48.840 --> 38:50.490
Yes, it's today.

39:01.670 --> 39:02.550
Xia Zi,

39:02.920 --> 39:04.050
happy birthday!

39:07.030 --> 39:07.800
What?

39:09.820 --> 39:11.220
I can't hear you clearly.

39:19.130 --> 39:20.380
Happy birthday.

39:25.270 --> 39:25.900
Thank you.

39:27.240 --> 39:27.960
Xia Zi,

39:29.990 --> 39:31.590
now that we're at this point,

39:33.130 --> 39:34.790
the only thing that's certain

39:35.030 --> 39:36.840
is that nothing is certain.

39:38.430 --> 39:41.290
Once you figure it out,
you won't be scared anymore.

39:42.420 --> 39:44.060
We've lost a lot now.

39:44.630 --> 39:45.760
We've been deceived

39:45.820 --> 39:46.710
and bullied.

39:46.730 --> 39:49.260
We feel like failures, get angry
and feel sad.

39:50.510 --> 39:53.150
As long as we're not dead,
let's live well.

39:55.110 --> 39:57.040
Eat a good meal when you're hungry.

39:57.280 --> 39:58.760
Take a nap if you're tired.

39:59.890 --> 40:01.280
Use these little things

40:01.530 --> 40:03.390
to raise yourself all over again.

41:30.440 --> 41:31.630
Hello.

41:31.760 --> 41:32.990
Have you left yet?

41:34.550 --> 41:35.680
It's the shop owner.

41:36.240 --> 41:36.950
What's up?

41:38.070 --> 41:39.200
We haven't left yet.

41:39.210 --> 41:41.460
I've found a car to take you.

41:41.490 --> 41:42.630
Found a car?

41:51.090 --> 41:53.470
Sis, what's planted here?

41:53.810 --> 41:54.880
This side is wheat,

41:55.150 --> 41:56.880
and that side is sea buckthorn.

41:57.880 --> 42:00.060
Shouldn't you pull these weeds?

42:00.670 --> 42:03.670
If you ask me, people elsewhere
are just too diligent.

42:03.720 --> 42:06.340
They rip out all the weeds

42:06.430 --> 42:07.960
that aren't useful to them.

42:08.060 --> 42:09.930
They exterminate all the insects.

42:09.930 --> 42:11.590
Except for the crops people eat,

42:11.590 --> 42:14.050
nothing else are allowed to grow
on the land.

42:14.260 --> 42:15.900
Busy every day,

42:16.110 --> 42:17.200
they never think about a bird

42:17.200 --> 42:19.030
flying overhead.

42:19.170 --> 42:20.560
Where will it land?

42:20.830 --> 42:22.630
Where are its food and water?

42:23.190 --> 42:24.940
But in the fields of Kashgar,

42:25.040 --> 42:27.370
a blade of grass can grow old safely

42:27.660 --> 42:29.780
without worrying about being removed.

42:29.780 --> 42:31.740
Human food and donkey weeds

42:31.740 --> 42:33.610
grow in the same field.

42:35.010 --> 42:38.570
Birds build nests in the trees
above the fields

42:38.600 --> 42:40.930
and catch bugs to eat when they're hungry.

42:41.010 --> 42:42.970
Sometimes they even eat wheat grains.

42:42.970 --> 42:45.100
And people pretend not to notice them.

42:45.460 --> 42:46.790
You talk so eloquently,

42:47.240 --> 42:48.120
and yet you still end up

42:48.120 --> 42:50.250
tired and stressed yourself?

42:51.050 --> 42:52.500
You are relaxed now,

42:52.530 --> 42:54.250
even cheerful when someone owes you money.

42:54.250 --> 42:55.040
You...

42:57.860 --> 42:59.060
You're right anyway.

42:59.280 --> 43:01.020
Just let yourself take a comfortable
little nap.
